er","start":85.961,"end":86.361},{"word":"gripped","start":86.361,"end":86.761},{"word":"by","start":86.761,"end":87.001},{"word":"both","start":87.001,"end":87.201},{"word":"legs,","start":87.201,"end":87.841},{"word":"clutching","start":87.841,"end":88.241},{"word":"the","start":88.241,"end":88.401},{"word":"tendons","start":88.401,"end":88.841},{"word":"of","start":88.841,"end":88.961},{"word":"his","start":88.961,"end":89.121},{"word":"feet.","start":89.121,"end":90.081},{"word":"From","start":90.081,"end":90.241},{"word":"our","start":90.241,"end":90.601},{"word":"bridge","start":90.601,"end":90.841},{"word":"the","start":90.841,"end":90.961},{"word":"demon","start":90.961,"end":91.441},{"word":"called:","start":91.441,"end":91.92}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"demons","text":"You Malebranche! Here's one of the elders\nfrom Saint Zita's city—thrust him under!\nI'm going back for more from that town\nso well-stocked with his kind.\nThey're all grafters there, except Bonturo—\nthere they turn No to Yes for cash.","startTime":91.92,"endTime":107.2,"words":[{"word":"You","start":91.92,"end":92.32},{"word":"Malebranche!","start":92.32,"end":93.6},{"word":"Here's","start":93.6,"end":93.88},{"word":"one","start":93.88,"end":94},{"word":"of","start":94,"end":94.12},{"word":"the","start":94.12,"end":94.24},{"word":"elders","start":94.24,"end":94.64},{"word":"from","start":94.64,"end":94.8},{"word":"Saint","start":94.8,"end":95.04},{"word":"Zita's","start":95.04,"end":95.6},{"word":"city—thrust","start":95.6,"end":96.48},{"word":"him","start":96.48,"end":96.64},{"word":"under!","start":96.64,"end":97.44},{"word":"I'm","start":97.44,"end":97.72},{"word":"going","start":97.72,"end":97.92},{"word":"back","start":97.92,"end":98.16},{"word":"for","start":98.16,"end":98.32},{"word":"more","start":98.32,"end":98.56},{"word":"from","start":98.56,"end":98.72},{"word":"that","start":98.72,"end":98.96},{"word":"town","start":98.96,"end":99.28},{"word":"so","start":99.28,"end":99.52},{"word":"well-stocked","start":99.52,"end":100.24},{"word":"with","start":100.24,"end":100.4},{"word":"his","start":100.4,"end":100.56},{"word":"kind.","start":100.56,"end":101.52},{"word":"They're","start":101.52,"end":101.76},{"word":"all","start":101.76,"end":102},{"word":"grafters","start":102,"end":102.56},{"word":"there,","start":102.56,"end":103.2},{"word":"except","start":103.2,"end":103.4},{"word":"Bonturo—","start":103.4,"end":104.56},{"word":"there","start":104.56,"end":104.88},{"word":"they","start":104.88,"end":105.04},{"word":"turn","start":105.04,"end":105.36},{"word":"No","start":105.36,"end":105.76},{"word":"to","start":105.76,"end":106},{"word":"Yes","start":106,"end":106.4},{"word":"for","start":106.4,"end":106.56},{"word":"cash.","start":106.56,"end":107.2}]},{"id":3,"speaker":"narrator","text":"He hurled the sinner down and wheeled back\nover the jagged cliff, and never was\na mastiff unleashed with such fury\nto chase a thief.\nThe sinner plunged and surfaced face-down,\nbut the demons beneath the bridge\nshouted: \"The Holy Face has no power here!\nHere you swim differently than in the Serchio!\nIf you don't want to feel our hooks,\ndon't try to rise above the pitch!\"\nThey struck him with a hundred prongs,\nsaying: \"Here you must dance underwater,\nso you can grab what you can in secret.\"\nJust so cooks make their kitchen boys\nplunge meat into the kettle's center\nwith forks, to keep it from floating up.\nMy good master said to me: \"Stay hidden—\ncrouch down behind that jutting rock\nso you'll have cover.\nDon't be afraid of any insult to me,\nfor I know how to handle this;\nI've been in such a fight before.\"\nHe passed beyond the bridge's head,\nand when he set foot on the sixth embankment,\nhe needed to show a bold face.\nWith the same fury and commotion\nas dogs that rush out at a beggar\nwho suddenly starts pleading wherever he stops,\nthe demons burst from beneath the bridge\nand turned all their grappling hooks on him.\nBut he cried: \"L